    {
      "text": "Spray a large skillet with cooking spray and heat over medium-low heat. Add onion; cook and stir until onion has softened and turned translucent, about 5 minutes. Add kielbasa; fry until sausage is lightly browned, stirring occasionally, about 5 minutes more.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/E5ACM_mjirl2SNhg0SmajGB2s9o=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/232907-easy-kielbasa-skillet-dinner-DDMFS-step-3-BG-2669-4a7dd09851804fe3905f7255bdd6e8fe.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/232907/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in potatoes and broccoli; season with salt and pepper. Cook, without stirring, until broccoli begins to soften, about 15 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/v9C9rAIyD-b2bdhvpPhItnyyVbA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/232907-easy-kielbasa-skillet-dinner-DDMFS-step-4-BG-2673-771d70c50e944c92bf39f32ccc5926ff.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/232907/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir well and continue to cook until vegetables are completely tender, 10 to 15 minutes more.",
